{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20260713/photo/bkn-20260713225000748-0713_00992_001_01p.jpg?20260713225310\"/><p>美國總統特朗普周一（13日）宣布，恢復對伊朗的海上封鎖。他又指，美國要接管霍爾木茲海峽，而伊朗一無所有。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-13T14:59:26.731541+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":60,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none"}}